rrorInSubSteps":false},{"stepId":"eb67dbfa00d8e947295e911af1a2cd91","name":"s02-list-after.md (/snf): Pass","status":"passed","steps":[{"link":{"id":"ff91b3a3e7e3f671d6ef82fcc133b8dd","originalFileName":"fe9c25fd-2711-48b8-92a3-7bd429793b48-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":2136},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"73fcddc10bbdc4e7fcb25f2dcd2abfd0","originalFileName":"bfc62777-d0e0-40de-a6c4-d8fbcbaf9d4d-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","contentType":"image/png","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":71082},"type":"attachment"}],"parameters":[],"start":1791939349340,"stop":1791939349340,"duration":0,"type":"step","hasSimilarErrorInSubSteps":false},{"link":{"id":"bfedb47741871e84baa7a8509405c5f2","originalFileName":"53f0768b-f6a8-447f-9a66-fb718148243e-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"agent's notes (facts it saw, not a verdict)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":2315},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"8bc2f68f1eb35f9ff502d91ac70aad0b","originalFileName":"6ae2e9e9-5ddb-483d-b8a4-91f2408b75b4-attachment.json","ext":".json","name":"oracle verdict","contentType":"application/json","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":4674},"type":"attachment"}],"error":{"message":"Checked by Quinn's runner (ledger.md #61): Pass — UAT TC-06 main flow both modes: add form toggle (default Follow-up), template preselected per badge, hand override, reload, list badge"},"testCase":{"id":"7e0fcf69219b7858a7fe527b19b40ea9","externalId":"419feda10d91cc861ed3633952b30709","name":"[dev] S02 Nursing Home walk (step 7): add-form default, list badge, all three states by hand incl. back to Follow-up, pre-selection, override, reload","fullName":"TC-06 Admission Status Toggle › TC-06/S02"},"descriptionHtml":"<div class=\"rc-approach\"><p><b>思路 / Approach</b> · TC-06 Admission Status Toggle · <b>S02</b> 「养老院走一遍（第 7 步）：添加表单默认值、列表徽章、手动选全部三个状态（包括改回 Follow-up）、预选、手动改模板、重新加载」 <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\" lang=\"en\">Nursing Home walk (step 7): add-form default, list badge, all three states by hand incl. back to Follow-up, pre-selection, override, reload</span></p><p><b>覆盖的 UAT 步骤 / 票 AC：</b></p><ul><li><b>U1</b> Nothing is ever New Admission (or Consult) unless the physician set it: the app never guesses the status, and a patient nobody has set reads Follow-up（UAT TC-06）</li><li><b>U3</b> The manual add form has the three-state toggle (New Admission / Follow-up / Consult) at creation, it defaults to Follow-up, and the state chosen there (or left untouched) is the one saved（UAT TC-06；TFA-92584 AC 2；TFA-92584 AC 3）</li><li><b>U4</b> The physician can change the badge by hand at any time (before or after Generate, and on a patient whose status already rolled) through all three states, and each change persists (list, chart, reload …（UAT TC-06；TFA-92584 AC 1）</li><li><b>U8</b> The badge pre-selects the template at Generate: Hospital New Admission -&gt; H&amp;P, Follow-up -&gt; SOAP progress, Consult -&gt; Consult note; …（UAT TC-06；TFA-92584 AC 6；TFA-92584 AC 7）</li><li><b>U9</b> The physician still sees the template picker at Generate and can change the pre-selected template by hand; changing the template does not change the badge, and Generate writes the note in the templat …（UAT TC-06；TFA-92584 AC 6）</li><li><b>U12</b> All of the above works in both Hospital and Nursing Home (step 7, ground rule 3.3)（UAT TC-06；UAT 3.3；TFA-92584 AC 7）</li><li><b>T2</b> Discharge templates (Discharge summary; SNF discharge once it exists) are never pre-selected by the badge in either context; they are only chosen by hand (UAT TC-06 step 6)（UAT TC-06；TFA-92584 AC 6；TFA-92599 AC 6）</li></ul><p><b>测试设计方法：</b>主流程（happy-path） — 照 UAT / 票的原话把正常流程走一遍，该出现的都要出现。</p><p><b>Given </b>Same fixture; the Nursing Home resident nobody has set a status for</p><p><b>When </b>Repeat S01 in Nursing Home: untouched Add Resident form; resident chart Encounter tab with Follow-up, New Admission, Consult; with Consult set, override Note Format to SNF admission; reload; list; then change the status by hand back to Follow-up (step 5 in Nursing Home); list again</p><p><b>Then </b>Add form Follow-up by default; Follow-up -&gt; SNF follow-up; New Admission -&gt; SNF admission; Consult never pre-selects SNF admission or SNF discharge; the override does not change the badge; Consult survives the reload and shows on the list; the hand change to Follow-up is saved, pre-selects SNF follow-up and shows on the list</p><p><b>通过的标准（oracle，节选）：</b>UAT TC-06 step 7 (steps 1-6 in Nursing Home, including step 3 'through all three states' and step 5's hand change to Follow-up) + TFA-92584 AC 6, 7. oracle.mjs on [selected] options. Nursing Home Consult must never pre-select SNF admission or SNF discharge (U8, not gated); …</p><p><b>在哪跑：</b>dev 单元 U61；测试方法 AGENT · 浏览器 agent；矩阵里排的车道 浏览器 agent（automated）</p><p><small>S02 是我们自己编的用例号（覆盖矩阵 cases/TC-06.matrix.json 里的编号），不是 UAT 文档里的步骤号。</small></p></div><p><b>环境：dev</b> — dev 部署，build <code>e02167f</code>（Deploy Convex，2026-10-12T18:24:27Z）；账号和地址不写进报告；run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>。</p><p><b>测试方法：</b>AGENT · 浏览器 agent；辅助：PW · Playwright 脚本 — 按 cases/test-methods.json 的分类，分类说在 both 跑；来源：<code>dev</code>。</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> TC-06 Admission Status Toggle · <b>Section:</b> A1 · Home Screen &amp; Dashboard · <b>Scenario:</b> TC-06/S02</p><p><b>Nursing Home walk (step 7): add-form default, list badge, all three states by hand incl. back to Follow-up, pre-selection, override, reload</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-92584 Admission Status Toggle (ready for qa); TFA-92599 Hospital vs. Nursing-Home Context Switch (in progress)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>units/U61.verdict.json</code>), unit U61 split by its parts' checkpoints. Agent: 88 turns, 217 s, $0.66.</p><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U61 (#51, rest, ui-only) — Badge walk with template pre-selection. Same legacy seed, same controls; S01 works only the Hospital patient and S02 only the resident, so neither touches the other's chart. Runs together with TC-06/S01.</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #61, U61; checked: yes): <b>Pass</b> — UAT TC-06 main flow both modes: add form toggle (default Follow-up), template preselected per badge, hand override, reload, list badge</p>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["TC-06 Admission Status Toggle","S02 Nursing Home walk (step 7): add-form default, list badge, all three states by hand incl. back to Fo…"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"id":"b6035562de55f731846d8b210e1ae2d8","originalFileName":"acbe1b11-09c4-4666-8178-0f1ee904dc24-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":1547},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"7022176d5e1af7497510e02f33d053ea","originalFileName":"e1ead77e-cd2d-4501-ba02-828ca0d6eb91-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","contentType":"image/png","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":51124},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"14cf8ba386682ce2a824f50167d08a77","originalFileName":"75dacf97-2cb0-4755-8b9b-e87820b6a9c6-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":2136},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"8a0b24d3d8d451ce3c1ddca64421025b","originalFileName":"c4096650-2d56-412c-a52e-a33be79df9b0-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","contentType":"image/png","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":71082},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"a4e1bc9572189219e32f58d539fe89ad","originalFileName":"8ac6ba1e-7c96-4144-828a-d27f8ea1110f-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"tex